dispatcher, enforced" on 2026-08-03 and it did NOT thereby become decoration.
Seventeen projects are parked and every one of them has a schedule/<p>.conf; a
row added to a rotation by an agent, a merge, or a copied file still dispatches
NOTHING until a human adds a line here. The roster is the allowlist. Growing it
